mapping "V8178.1" source="V8178" target="213859004" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.71 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V8178 = Swedish extension of ICD-10 V81.7 (Occupant of railway train injured in
        derailment without antecedent collision) with 5th-char activity specifier SNOMED CT 213859004
        (other specified activities). Target SNOMED CT 435703 (Railway accident involving derailment
        without antecedent collision, code 213859004) is the exact WHO V81.7 crosswalk target in the
        Athena mirror. Mapping is broader: target fully subsumes the source but does not capture the
        activity dimension (which has no SNOMED CT representation). Moderate tier: verified crosswalk at
        the 4-char base level, Swedish extension adds an unmappable activity facet.
        """
}
mapping "V8179.1" source="V8179" target="213859004" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target effect=omitted quality=40 {
    confidence 0.71 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V8179 = Swedish extension of V81.7 (railway derailment without antecedent collision) with
        activity SNOMED CT 213859004 (unspecified). Target SNOMED CT 435703 (213859004) is the WHO V81.7
        crosswalk target. Broader: target subsumes source without the activity facet. Moderate tier:
        crosswalk-verified at base level.
        """
}
mapping "V8180.1" source="V8180" target="213770003" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V8180 = Swedish extension of V81.8 (other specified railway accidents) with activity
        SNOMED CT 213770003 (sport/exercise). WHO V81.8 maps to SNOMED CT 440896 (Railway accident, 213770003)
        and 444074 (Victim of vehicular AND/OR traffic accident). 440896 chosen as more specific to
        railway context. Broader: target subsumes source; loses both the detail and the activity facet.
        Low tier: heterogeneous residual base code, two crosswalk targets, plus unmappable Swedish
        activity extension.
        """
}
